  ('Dokter Spesialis Kedokteran Komunitas', 'Apply knowledge of general preventive medicine and public health issues to promote health care to groups or individuals, and aid in the prevention or reduction of risk of disease, injury, disability, or death. May practice population-based medicine or diagnose and treat patients in the context of cl', 5, NULL, NULL, NULL, '29-1229.05', 'Preventive Medicine Physicians', 'Sp.KKom; Preventive Medicine Physician', 5, 'terbatas', 'onet', true, NULL, 'none', 'perlu verifikasi nomenklatur gelar terkini; jumlah praktisi sedikit dan lebih banyak di institusi kesehatan masyarakat/akademik.'),
