  ('Ahli Teknologi Laboratorium Medik', 'Perform complex medical laboratory tests for diagnosis, treatment, and prevention of disease. May train or supervise staff.', 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, '29-2011.00', 'Medical and Clinical Laboratory Technologists', 'ATLM; Medical Laboratory Technologist', 4, 'umum', 'onet', true, NULL, 'none', 'ATLM adalah nomenklatur resmi Kemenkes untuk tenaga laboratorium medik jenjang D4/S1.'),
  ('Teknolog Sitogenetika', 'Analyze chromosomes or chromosome segments found in biological specimens, such as amniotic fluids, bone marrow, solid tumors, and blood to aid in the study, diagnosis, classification, or treatment of inherited or acquired genetic diseases. Conduct analyses through classical cytogenetic, fluorescent ', 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, '29-2011.01', 'Cytogenetic Technologists', 'Cytogenetic Technologist', 4, 'terbatas', 'onet', true, NULL, 'none', 'Subspesialisasi ATLM yang sangat niche, hanya di laboratorium rujukan/riset genetika tertentu.'),
  ('Sitoteknologis', 'Stain, mount, and study cells to detect evidence of cancer, hormonal abnormalities, and other pathological conditions following established standards and practices.', 5, NULL, NULL, NULL, '29-2011.02', 'Cytotechnologists', 'Cytotechnologist', 5, 'terbatas', 'onet', true, NULL, 'none', 'Subspesialisasi ATLM di bidang sitologi, umumnya bekerja sama dengan Sp.PA di laboratorium patologi anatomi.'),
  ('Histoteknologis', 'Apply knowledge of health and disease causes to evaluate new laboratory techniques and procedures to examine tissue samples. Process and prepare histological slides from tissue sections for microscopic examination and diagnosis by pathologists. May solve technical or instrument problems or assist wi', 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, '29-2011.04', 'Histotechnologists', 'Histotechnologist', 4, 'terbatas', 'onet', true, NULL, 'none', 'Subspesialisasi ATLM di bidang histologi/jaringan, jumlah tenaga terbatas.'),
  ('Ahli Teknologi Laboratorium Medik (Jenjang Teknisi)', 'Perform routine medical laboratory tests for the diagnosis, treatment, and prevention of disease. May work under the supervision of a medical technologist.', 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, '29-2012.00', 'Medical and Clinical Laboratory Technicians', 'ATLM D3; Medical Laboratory Technician', 3, 'umum', 'onet', true, NULL, 'none', 'O*NET memisahkan technologist (S1/D4) dan technician (D3); di Indonesia keduanya umum disebut ATLM dengan jenjang pendidikan berbeda.'),
  ('Teknisi Histologi', 'Prepare histological slides from tissue sections for microscopic examination and diagnosis by pathologists. May assist with research studies.', 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, '29-2012.01', 'Histology Technicians', 'Histology Technician', 3, 'terbatas', 'onet', true, NULL, 'none', 'Bagian dari ATLM dengan peminatan histologi/patologi anatomi.'),
  ('Teknisi Kardiovaskular', 'Conduct tests on pulmonary or cardiovascular systems of patients for diagnostic, therapeutic, or research purposes. May conduct or assist in electrocardiograms, cardiac catheterizations, pulmonary functions, lung capacity, and similar tests.', 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, '29-2031.00', 'Cardiovascular Technologists and Technicians', 'Perekam EKG; Cardiovascular Technician', 3, 'terbatas', 'onet', true, NULL, 'none', 'Belum jadi profesi mandiri yang luas; fungsi sering dijalankan perawat, ATLM, atau radiografer terlatih.'),
  ('Sonografer', 'Produce ultrasonic recordings of internal organs for use by physicians. Includes vascular technologists.', 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, '29-2032.00', 'Diagnostic Medical Sonographers', 'Diagnostic Medical Sonographer', 3, 'terbatas', 'onet', true, NULL, 'none', 'USG di Indonesia umumnya dilakukan langsung oleh dokter (radiolog/obgyn), belum umum sebagai profesi sonografer mandiri seperti di AS.'),
  ('Radiografer Kedokteran Nuklir', 'Prepare, administer, and measure radioactive isotopes in therapeutic, diagnostic, and tracer studies using a variety of radioisotope equipment. Prepare stock solutions of radioactive materials and calculate doses to be administered by radiologists. Subject patients to radiation. Execute blood volume', 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, '29-2033.00', 'Nuclear Medicine Technologists', 'Nuclear Medicine Technologist', 3, 'terbatas', 'onet', true, NULL, 'none', 'Peminatan niche dari profesi Radiografer, hanya di RS dengan fasilitas kedokteran nuklir.'),
  ('Radiografer', 'Take x-rays and CAT scans or administer nonradioactive materials into patient''s bloodstream for diagnostic or research purposes. Includes radiologic technologists and technicians who specialize in other scanning modalities.', 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, '29-2034.00', 'Radiologic Technologists and Technicians', 'Radiologic Technologist', 3, 'umum', 'onet', true, NULL, 'none', 'Nomenklatur resmi Kemenkes untuk tenaga rontgen/pencitraan diagnostik.'),
  ('Radiografer MRI', 'Operate Magnetic Resonance Imaging (MRI) scanners. Monitor patient safety and comfort, and view images of area being scanned to ensure quality of pictures. May administer gadolinium contrast dosage intravenously. May interview patient, explain MRI procedures, and position patient on examining table.', 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, '29-2035.00', 'Magnetic Resonance Imaging Technologists', 'MRI Technologist', 3, 'terbatas', 'onet', true, NULL, 'none', 'Peminatan Radiografer di fasilitas dengan mesin MRI, hanya RS besar.'),
  ('Fisikawan Medik (Dosimetri Radioterapi)', 'Generate radiation treatment plans, develop radiation dose calculations, communicate and supervise the treatment plan implementation, and consult with members of radiation oncology team.', 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, '29-2036.00', 'Medical Dosimetrists', 'Medical Dosimetrist', 4, 'terbatas', 'onet', true, NULL, 'none', 'Jumlah tenaga sangat sedikit, hanya di pusat radioterapi RS rujukan kanker.'),
