  ('Paramedis', 'Administer basic or advanced emergency medical care and assess injuries and illnesses. May administer medication intravenously, use equipment such as EKGs, or administer advanced life support to sick or injured individuals.', 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, '29-2043.00', 'Paramedics', 'Paramedic', 3, 'terbatas', 'onet', true, NULL, 'none', 'Istilah ''paramedis'' di Indonesia sering dipakai lebih luas untuk tenaga kesehatan non-dokter; jenjang sertifikasi paramedik ambulans spesifik seperti di AS belum terstandardisasi luas.'),
  ('Teknisi Gizi', 'Assist in the provision of food service and nutritional programs, under the supervision of a dietitian. May plan and produce meals based on established guidelines, teach principles of food and nutrition, or counsel individuals.', 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, '29-2051.00', 'Dietetic Technicians', 'Tenaga Pelaksana Gizi; Dietetic Technician', 3, 'terbatas', 'onet', true, NULL, 'none', 'Umumnya digabung dengan jenjang Ahli Gizi D3, belum jadi kategori terpisah yang luas.'),
  ('Tenaga Teknis Kefarmasian', 'Prepare medications under the direction of a pharmacist. May measure, mix, count out, label, and record amounts and dosages of medications according to prescription orders.', 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, '29-2052.00', 'Pharmacy Technicians', 'TTK; Pharmacy Technician', 3, 'umum', 'onet', true, NULL, 'none', 'TTK adalah nomenklatur resmi Kemenkes.'),
