  ('Teknolog Oftalmik', 'Assist ophthalmologists by performing ophthalmic clinical functions and ophthalmic photography. Provide instruction and supervision to other ophthalmic personnel. Assist with minor surgical procedures, applying aseptic techniques and preparing instruments. May perform eye exams, administer eye medic', 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, '29-2099.05', 'Ophthalmic Medical Technologists', 'Refraksionis Optisien Lanjutan; Ophthalmic Medical Technologist', 3, 'terbatas', 'onet', true, NULL, 'none', 'Jenjang lanjutan dari asisten klinik mata, overlap dengan Refraksionis Optisien.'),
