  ('Analis Informasi Kesehatan', 'Apply knowledge of healthcare and information systems to assist in the design, development, and continued modification and analysis of computerized healthcare systems. Abstract, collect, and analyze treatment and followup information of patients. May educate staff and assist in problem solving to pr', 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, '29-9021.00', 'Health Information Technologists and Medical Registrars', 'Perekam Medis dan Informasi Kesehatan; Health Information Technologist', 3, 'terbatas', 'onet', true, NULL, 'none', 'Overlap dengan PMIK, tapi peran ini lebih ke analisis sistem/data kesehatan (health informatics), jumlah tenaga masih sedikit.'),
  ('Fisioterapis Olahraga', 'Evaluate and treat musculoskeletal injuries or illnesses. Provide preventive, therapeutic, emergency, and rehabilitative care.', 5, NULL, NULL, NULL, '29-9091.00', 'Athletic Trainers', 'Athletic Trainer', 5, 'terbatas', 'onet', true, NULL, 'none', 'Belum ada profesi ''athletic trainer'' bersertifikasi terpisah seperti di AS; fungsi dijalankan fisioterapis olahraga atau pelatih fisik.'),
