  ('Asisten Bedah', 'Assist in operations, under the supervision of surgeons. May, in accordance with state laws, help surgeons to make incisions and close surgical sites, manipulate or remove tissues, implant surgical devices or drains, suction the surgical site, place catheters, clamp or cauterize vessels or tissue, a', 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, '29-9093.00', 'Surgical Assistants', 'Surgical Assistant', 3, 'terbatas', 'onet', true, NULL, 'none', 'Fungsi umumnya dijalankan perawat kamar bedah atau dokter residen, belum jadi profesi mandiri bersertifikasi terpisah.'),
